    { :ClauseH2 :clauseId "H2" . },
    { (1000 100) math:difference 900 . },
    { ("### Clause %s — score %s\n\n**Risk level:** `%s`\n**Severity:** `%s`\n\n%s\n\n" "H2" 100 risk:HighRisk risk:HighSeverity "Risk: genomic data may be shared with external pharma partners without a de-identification/pseudonymisation requirement. Clause H2: Hospital may share genomic data with pharmaceutical partners for drug discovery and R&D.") string:format "### Clause H2 — score 100\n\n**Risk level:** `https://w3id.org/dpv/risk#HighRisk`\n**Severity:** `https://w3id.org/dpv/risk#HighSeverity`\n\nRisk: genomic data may be shared with external pharma partners without a de-identification/pseudonymisation requirement. Clause H2: Hospital may share genomic data with pharmaceutical partners for drug discovery and R&D.\n\n" . }.

{ ("### Clause %s — score %s\n\n**Risk level:** `%s`\n**Severity:** `%s`\n\n%s\n\n" "H2" 100 risk:HighRisk risk:HighSeverity "Risk: genomic data may be shared with external pharma partners without a de-identification/pseudonymisation requirement. Clause H2: Hospital may share genomic data with pharmaceutical partners for drug discovery and R&D.") string:format "### Clause H2 — score 100\n\n**Risk level:** `https://w3id.org/dpv/risk#HighRisk`\n**Severity:** `https://w3id.org/dpv/risk#HighSeverity`\n\nRisk: genomic data may be shared with external pharma partners without a de-identification/pseudonymisation requirement. Clause H2: Hospital may share genomic data with pharmaceutical partners for drug discovery and R&D.\n\n" . }
